; Template for the local BIND 9's update.test. zone: the zone the RFC 9664 handler serves in
; tests/test_update.sh's local mode (AUTH_BACKEND=local), whose client registers under
; test.update.test. start_bind9 copies this into the scratch runtime directory before
; starting named, same as srp.test.zone.in -- BIND rewrites its own working copy (SOA serial
; bumps, dynamic-update journal replay) so the source tree's copy must never be the one
; actually served.
;
; The apex KEY is tests/keystore-update-bind9/'s own key, granted zonesub update rights in
; named.conf.in -- the proxy signs every forwarded UPDATE with this same key
; (handlers.update's keystore_dir points at that directory in that mode).
$TTL 3600
@       IN SOA  ns.update.test. admin.update.test. ( 1 3600 900 604800 3600 )
        IN NS   ns.update.test.
ns      IN A    127.0.0.1
@       IN KEY  512 3 15 RtByNLbvegpkz2HRTmOPc3rNy7fpNCJZbz+hjFYiDec=
